cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata. To cite a paper, use the citation on its page at https://w3ft.org/papers/."
type: software
title: "ML Weft"
abstract: >-
  An open research program on models that keep adapting after deployment, under limits that a program can verify:
  bounded cells with a frozen core and a commit rule, hashed message packets, a serialised graph language with
  committed execution records, and the Eido design language.
authors:
  - family-names: Arifuddin
    given-names: Ahraz
    affiliation: Moissanite Labs
repository-code: "https://github.com/Moissanite-Labs/weft"
url: "https://w3ft.org"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - adaptive models
  - AI safety
  - verification
  - continual learning
  - interaction combinators
